# Skill eval scratch. The eval SET is committed (.claude/skills/*/evals/) and so
# is the benchmark summary each iteration produces; the per-run outputs and
# transcripts under the workspace are bulky, regenerable, and accumulate one
# directory per iteration, so they stay local.
.claude/skills/*-workspace/
# Hand specs written by eval runs, as opposed to real reported hands.
scripts/hands/eval*.json
